usage: submission_cli.py [-h] [--payloads PAYLOADS] [--label LABEL]
                         [--limit LIMIT] [--sleep-on-429] [--dry-run]
                         [--server-dry-run] [--allow-non-headline]

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --payloads PAYLOADS   JSON payload queue
  --label LABEL         Submit only this label
  --limit LIMIT         Submit at most N payloads
  --sleep-on-429
  --dry-run
  --server-dry-run      Validate projected payloads against the authenticated
                        LocalMaxxing dry-run endpoint without writing a result
  --allow-non-headline  Inspect diagnostic/non-headline payloads such as
                        warmed/history n-gram artifacts. This is restricted to
                        --dry-run; real submissions fail closed.
